format-version: 1.4
data-version: 0.2.0
ontology: mzpeak
default-namespace: mzpeak
remark: Converter-owned provisional controlled vocabulary for mzPeakConverter. These terms cover the
remark: TOF/IMS grid encoding (integer-grid -> m/z reconstruction transforms and their per-spectrum
remark: coefficients) and are NOT yet in PSI-MS. They use the local MZP prefix instead of squatting the
remark: PSI-owned MS namespace. Each carries a "suggested PSI-MS name" so it can be retired in favour of
remark: an assigned MS term once the mzPeak specification standardises the grid layout (see BACKLOG.md).
remark: Prefix MZP resolves to this file.

[Term]
id: MZP:1000001
name: square-root m/z from TOF index transformation
def: "An array transformation that reconstructs an m/z array from a stored integer time-of-flight index k as m/z = (c0 + c1*k)^2. The coefficients [c0, c1] are carried in the array's transform parameters. Used for profile/raw time-of-flight data acquired on the flight-time lattice." []
comment: Provisional; suggested PSI-MS name "square-root m/z from TOF index transformation". Sibling of the null-marking transforms MS:1003901 / MS:1003902.

[Term]
id: MZP:1000002
name: linear m/z grid transformation
def: "An array transformation that reconstructs an m/z array from a stored integer index k as m/z = s*k, where s is a uniform bin width carried in the array's transform parameters. Used for centroided time-of-flight data that no longer sits on the flight-time lattice." []
comment: Provisional; suggested PSI-MS name "linear m/z grid transformation".

[Term]
id: MZP:1000003
name: time-of-flight grid coefficient c0
def: "The constant term c0 of the per-spectrum square-root TOF reconstruction m/z = (c0 + c1*k)^2, stored as a per-spectrum value of type double." []
comment: Provisional spectrum/scan attribute.

[Term]
id: MZP:1000004
name: time-of-flight grid coefficient c1
def: "The linear term c1 of the per-spectrum square-root TOF reconstruction m/z = (c0 + c1*k)^2, stored as a per-spectrum value of type double." []
comment: Provisional spectrum/scan attribute.

[Term]
id: MZP:1000005
name: time-of-flight calibration identifier
def: "Selects the per-spectrum polynomial-refinement row in the tof_calibration index block, so the exact vendor m/z reconstructs. Stored as a per-spectrum non-negative integer." []
comment: Provisional spectrum/scan attribute.

[Term]
id: MZP:1000006
name: isolation window inverse reduced ion mobility lower limit
def: "Lower 1/K0 bound of the mobility range this isolation window occupies within its frame. A dia-PASEF frame carries several isolation windows over disjoint, generally ASYMMETRIC mobility ranges; without explicit bounds a reader can only guess the split from window midpoints, which on real data misassigns several percent of the mobility axis. Stored as a per-isolation-window value of type double, in V*s/cm^2." []
comment: Provisional isolation-window attribute.

[Term]
id: MZP:1000007
name: isolation window inverse reduced ion mobility upper limit
def: "Upper 1/K0 bound of the mobility range this isolation window occupies within its frame. See MZP:1000006. Stored as a per-isolation-window value of type double, in V*s/cm^2." []
comment: Provisional isolation-window attribute.

[Term]
id: MZP:1000008
name: TDF frame digitizer temperature T1
def: "The per-frame `Frames.T1` value of a Bruker timsTOF analysis.tdf: the digitizer temperature that enters the vendor's ModelType-1 TOF-to-m/z model as C1_eff = C1 * (1 + dC1 * (T1_calibration - T1_frame) / 1e6). Stored as a per-spectrum value of type double." []
comment: Provisional spectrum/scan attribute; a vendor-model input, not a PSI quantity. Column suffix `_tdf_t1`.

[Term]
id: MZP:1000009
name: TDF frame digitizer temperature T2
def: "The per-frame `Frames.T2` value of a Bruker timsTOF analysis.tdf, the second temperature the vendor records beside T1. Stored as a per-spectrum value of type double." []
comment: Provisional spectrum/scan attribute; a vendor-model input, not a PSI quantity. Column suffix `_tdf_t2`.

[Term]
id: MZP:1000010
name: TDF frame m/z calibration identifier
def: "The per-frame `Frames.MzCalibration` value of a Bruker timsTOF analysis.tdf: selects the `MzCalibration` row (carried verbatim in the archive's `vendor_mz_calibration` index block) whose coefficients apply to this frame. Stored as a per-spectrum non-negative integer." []
comment: Provisional spectrum/scan attribute. Column suffix `_tdf_mz_calibration_id`.
